<title>USA: Science Dynamics keeps Nasdaq listing.</title>
<headline>Science Dynamics keeps Nasdaq listing.</headline>
<dateline>CHERRY HILL, N.J. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Science Dynamics Corp said Friday its common stock would continue to be listed on the Nasdaq SmallCap Market after being granted an exception from the total assets requirement.</p>
<p>While Science Dynamics failed to meet the requirement as of August 14, it obtained a temporary exception, subject to its meeting certain conditions.</p>
<p>The company issued a statement saying it believed it could meet the conditions, though it could not assure that it would do so.</p>
